Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.99,0:01:45.00,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Eptitle sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(528,479)\pos(437.578,302.556)}Episode 6                    First Date?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.15,0:01:52.57,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin! I need to grab some tools!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.88,0:01:53.80,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:02:00.96,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, a sailor uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.13,0:02:05.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It looks cute on you. Maybe you \Nshould try transferring schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.61,0:02:09.10,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's not really a casual thing to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.39,0:02:11.01,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.01,0:02:14.85,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,And if you changed schools, \NI wouldn't get to see your acting anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.67,0:02:20.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Still, the idea of being reunited at work\Nafter a few years... That'd be pretty cool too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.20,0:02:26.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,No matter where I go, \NI promise to keep acting!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:29.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That way, we'll be reunited soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.36,0:02:31.23,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.03,0:02:36.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'll show you an even \Nbetter performance someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:38.77,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.36,0:02:45.14,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So... please, don't forget about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:51.56,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Uh, Senpai?! I was just acting! Acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.02,0:02:54.47,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I know, but...!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.71,0:02:59.16,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I started thinking about you \Nactually changing schools, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:04.55,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I didn't realize how sad it'd make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.55,0:03:07.77,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.84,0:03:11.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Why are you so happy about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.92,0:03:20.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Even if we're separated, \NI'll never forget you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.04,0:03:24.00,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So, let's see each other \Nagain once we're grown up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.98,0:03:26.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Underneath the promise tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.80,0:03:33.19,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I really can't focus like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.49,0:03:37.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What else can we do? \NThe prop isn't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.06,0:03:38.59,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Don't mind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.39,0:03:44.38,main,Rin,0,0,0,,"Once we're grown up," I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.88,0:03:47.78,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That was quite a vague promise to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.43,0:03:49.61,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's been five years...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.07,0:03:56.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm here again, now that I'm 20, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.38,0:03:58.98,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Will he show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.41,0:04:02.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The line is "That man."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.72,0:04:06.30,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Um... could the tree please not talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:10.01,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That man would never break his promise...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.67,0:04:13.97,main,Rin,0,0,0,,And they do say women mature faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:17.78,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe to him, 20 years old \Nisn't grown up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:20.98,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Just like a tree...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.51,0:04:25.68,main,Rin,0,0,0,,We're both still children... really...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.64,0:04:29.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Quit treating me like a kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.09,0:04:33.25,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I can't take this anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.29,0:04:37.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's now been fifteen years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.75,0:04:41.67,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Surely 30 years old must be grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.44,0:04:47.51,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Wait, doesn't the next scene involve \Nme crying and clinging to this tree?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.84,0:04:52.46,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Where could he be..? Why isn't he here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:55.04,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Uh... er...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:04:58.86,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Bring it in, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.40,0:05:02.31,main,Prez,0,0,0,,Dang it, Eiji! Quit talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:08.04,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I can't do this in front of other people...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:11.12,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,Maybe if we were alone...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.29,0:05:15.83,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, this was a lucky \Nchance to see your acting up close!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.28,0:05:24.02,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,If only we were alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.92,0:05:27.26,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:29.51,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Good morn—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.41,0:05:35.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Are you recording already?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:36.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.98,0:05:40.15,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm getting the inside \Nscoop on our lead actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.21,sign_8164_58_Now_recording__M,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\3c&HC3E7C8&\pos(325.6,220.4)}{\blur1\c&H7A8E7F&}Now \Nrecording \NMaking-Of\N Interview!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.21,0:05:42.73,sign_8164_58_Now_recording__M,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs14\3c&HC3E7C8&\move(324,221.2,323.2,10,6,507)}{\blur1\c&H7A8E7F&}Now \Nrecording \NMaking-Of\N Interview!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.04,0:05:46.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This'll be one more thing to put on \Ndisplay for the culture festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.84,0:05:49.02,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What does acting mean to you, Nanakura-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.61,0:05:51.13,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Isn't it early for that question?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:58.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Shoot... I can't think of any questions...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:05.17,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Did you watch that show yesterday? \N{\i1}Sweatpants Detective.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:10.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Is... that your interview question?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.11,0:06:13.45,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I didn't think to prepare any!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.45,0:06:16.92,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Let's continue this during lunch. \NTo the cafeteria!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.17,0:06:18.59,main,Rin,0,0,0,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:22.49,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,This comprehensive coverage is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.45,0:06:32.95,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs16\c&H35353A&\b1\frx2\fry346\frz357.3\pos(477.4,67)}Ginger-Fried Pork Lunch
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:35.85,main,rin,0,0,0,,I'll get you one of the same, cameraman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:44.55,sign_9496_73_Kitahama_s__Docu,Sign; clockwise from top right,0,0,0,,{\pos(539.8,115.8)\c&H435A5D&}Kitahama's \NDocumentary
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:44.55,sign_9496_73_Kitahama_s__Docu,Sign; clockwise from top right,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\pos(515,317.4)}Actress
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.04,0:06:44.55,sign_9496_75_Nanakura_Rin,Sign; clockwise from top right,0,0,0,,{\fs18\pos(156.6,292.6)}Nanakura Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.53,0:06:40.40,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,"Before a big performance, \Nleading woman Nanakura Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.40,0:06:43.64,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,always comes here \Nfor the ginger-fried pork."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.85,0:06:47.21,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That sounded pretty authentic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.63,0:06:48.79,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Do you actually do that, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.21,0:06:51.46,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Not really, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.64,0:06:58.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I get to eat with Senpai! Lunch with Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.50,0:07:02.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,How do you feel when you've landed \Nthe leading role in a production?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.12,0:07:05.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So much fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.74,0:07:07.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You have fun with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:11.20,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Er, no! I-I was talking \Nabout something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.62,0:07:14.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:17.71,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm not sure a staple food like \Nginger-fried pork would suit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.71,0:07:19.96,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,the palate of a princess \Nlike Tsundere-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:26.07,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I usually don't eat this sort of thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:32.29,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,I-It seems fine, I guess!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.64,0:07:35.93,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I think I'm going to hold onto this \Nfootage for my personal collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:37.48,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Please erase it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.11,0:07:42.17,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Also, should we be \Nfooling around like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.39,0:07:44.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Crud, we don't have much time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.44,0:07:46.50,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Do you have any thoughts as the star?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.50,0:07:48.20,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Make it a good one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.32,0:07:50.62,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.89,0:07:54.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I honestly don't think of \Nit in terms of being a lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.33,0:07:58.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,A production is always a group effort,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:03.95,main,Rin,0,0,0,,and I just try to do my best for my part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.60,0:08:06.71,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'd say. Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:12.45,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Senpai?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.04,0:08:15.88,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The battery!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.88,0:08:16.79,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.79,0:08:18.68,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.60,0:08:23.34,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So, will the coverage be \Ncontinuing after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.10,0:08:25.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.71,0:08:28.49,main,Rin,0,0,0,,But you have to take it seriously this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.49,0:08:30.49,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.48,0:08:37.49,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Man, I've never spent a night at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:40.49,main,Rin,0,0,0,,The night before an event \Nis always so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.76,0:08:43.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I got so excited I volunteered \Nfor the shopping team, but then
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:46.41,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I realized I still had a bunch \Nof other stuff I hadn't finished...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.41,0:08:49.00,main,rin,0,0,0,,That's not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.00,0:08:51.75,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Anyway, what do you wanna do about dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:54.51,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Well, maybe some bento boxes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:57.27,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, look! The beef is on sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.26,0:09:02.52,main,Sale sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H61509D&\3c&HEAF8EF&\b1\fs20\frz27.42\pos(112,138)}Sale! 30% Off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.27,0:08:59.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe we could whip up some sukiyaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.61,0:09:02.52,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Except we can't use any gas...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:06.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,But it's a special occasion! \NThat means we should eat special food!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:11.59,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin, is there anything you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.85,0:09:13.77,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm good with anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:16.79,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's the hardest response \Nto work with, y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:19.02,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Japanese? Western? Chinese?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.64,0:09:21.03,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Japanese food, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.32,0:09:23.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Then we gotta do sukiyaki, after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.78,0:09:29.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Having to put thought into food \Ntakes more effort than I imagined...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:33.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If we get married, would we be \Ndoing stuff like this every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:38.43,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Are you... talking about... with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:44.44,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Would you be willing to make \Nsukiyaki for me every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:47.98,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's... honestly asking too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.93,0:10:07.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.04,0:10:12.96,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Uh... bathroom... can't go...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.66,0:10:25.47,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,There are other students around! \Nyou don't need to be so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.48,0:10:30.29,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,What about getting into \Na character who's less afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.29,0:10:33.72,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I get the feeling Cool-chan \Nmight actually enjoy spooky stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.28,0:10:40.19,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Ghosts... I like... ghosts...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.66,0:10:40.19,main - top,Eiji,0,0,0,,That's just regular Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.16,0:10:47.23,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Don't be! Don't be! Afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.23,0:10:50.00,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Rin-chan's a strong girl! She's just fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.00,0:10:52.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Totally fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.00,0:10:55.05,main,Rin,0,0,0,,After the night comes the dawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:56.51,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,As it should be! There we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.51,0:11:02.51,main,Rin,0,0,0,,D-don't... d-don't be... \Ndon't don't be... afraid!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:06.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I... I can't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.32,0:11:08.89,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You've got this, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.89,0:11:13.90,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)\pos(550.266,99.912)}{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(520.556,347.556)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo\N {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:11.96,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Please wait right here, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.90,0:11:18.90,sign_18558_208_Psuedo_Harem,Eyecatch sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(522,1)\pos(159.066,289.512)}{\c&HF1D9FF&\pos(520.556,347.556)}Pse{\c&HFFFDC6&}udo {\c&HFFFFFF&}Harem
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:24.41,sign_16278_151_Kouban__Private_,Front Gate Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur2\frz5.522\pos(572.8,246)}Kouban \NPrivate\NHigh\N School
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.90,0:11:24.41,sign_16278_151_Kouban__Private_,Front Gate Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(97.6,275.6)}{\blur2\fs16}64th\N Cultural \NFestival
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:27.41,sign_16410_153_Fried_Chicken_,Tables signs; right to left,0,0,0,,{\fs12\frz349.9\pos(369.6,119)}Fried Chicken
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:27.41,sign_16410_153_Fried_Chicken_,Tables signs; right to left,0,0,0,,{\c&H635362&\fs12\pos(167.2,26.2)\frz350.5}Iced \NCoffee
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:27.41,sign_16410_153_Fried_Chicken_,Tables signs; right to left,0,0,0,,{\fs11\c&H3F568B&\frz352.4\pos(31.2,110.2)}Ice Cream
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.41,0:11:30.91,sign_7050_55_Episode_1_______,Blackboard Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HEEF7F0&\frz357.5\move(476.6,47,379.8,46.2,26,3488)}{\blur0.4}Song Intro Quiz
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.11,0:11:37.71,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I wanna go around the culture \Nfestival with Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:40.43,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.68,0:11:42.25,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:44.68,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Are you all done setting up the stage?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.96,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Not even close!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.96,0:11:51.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Next is the non-stop round trips \Nwhere I bring in all the tiny parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.96,0:11:53.81,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'll help out, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:57.69,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous. \NBackstage stuff is our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.06,0:12:00.58,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,You need to focus on your performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:01.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:02.83,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.72,0:12:09.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I bought it on my way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:11.97,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.76,0:12:14.18,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,All right, I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:15.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:18.34,sign_17643_172_Takoyaki,Booth signs,0,0,0,,{\frz345.3}Takoyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.83,0:12:18.34,sign_17643_173_Frankfurters,Booth signs,0,0,0,,{\fs24\pos(102.8,298.6)\frz344.4}Frankfurters
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:20.84,sign_17703_174_Kouban_Festival,Banner sign,0,0,0,,{\frz8.881\pos(306.4,142.8)}Kouban Festival
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.52,0:12:25.01,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, Rin, you around?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:28.40,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I grabbed these on the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.28,0:12:30.60,main,Rin,0,0,0,,All of that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:33.10,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.97,0:12:36.35,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin! Check out this stuff they were selling!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:37.98,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.39,0:12:45.36,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai, this isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.36,0:12:48.42,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I-I just wanted to give you \Na taste of the festival,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.42,0:12:50.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,since you don't get to walk around...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:54.38,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Then I want to help set up, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:09.08,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, I finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.38,0:13:11.10,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Almost time for the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.62,0:13:13.64,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a little nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.84,0:13:16.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.89,0:13:21.06,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,If you do a good job acting, \NI'll give you a reward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:22.60,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,A reward?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.57,0:13:24.57,sign_9496_73_Kitahama_s__Docu,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HFCF7FF&\fs19\pos(517.4,82.2)}Reward?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.54,0:13:30.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh, but then I really need \Nto get it right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:32.57,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.57,0:13:36.83,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,In that case, how about you \Nget a reward either way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:38.99,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Are you okay with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.34,0:13:43.69,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I realize it makes no sense, but sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.36,0:13:48.62,main,Rin,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.48,0:13:54.09,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I want to go on a date with you, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.77,0:13:56.89,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,A date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.89,0:14:00.63,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-I didn't get to go around \Nthe culture festival at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:02.40,main,Rin,0,0,0,,So, y'know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:05.48,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh man, now I'm feeling nervous too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:19.35,main,Rin,0,0,0,,A date! A date! Where should we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:22.90,main,Rin,0,0,0,,The aquarium might be nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.17,0:14:23.17,sign_20624_204_Aquarium,Magazine headline,0,0,0,,{\frz0.8401\pos(246.8,108)}Aquarium
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:26.99,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Look there, Rin! What a cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.40,0:14:30.92,main - italics,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,Even cuter than me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.92,0:14:33.24,main - italics,Eiji,0,0,0,,Oh, you spoiled girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.67,0:14:39.68,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I think maybe we'll just stick to shopping!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.36,0:14:44.94,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I wonder where...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.58,0:14:49.49,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai would like to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.96,0:15:01.44,sign_21602_212_Kyoto,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HE4EFEF&\3c&HBCC0B8&\move(532.8,144.4,460.8,130,23,440)}Kyoto
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.44,0:15:04.90,sign_21602_212_Kyoto,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&HE4EFEF&\3c&HBCC0B8&\pos(456,130.8)}Kyoto
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:07.05,main,Rin,0,0,0,,K-Kyoto?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.08,0:15:11.09,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I managed to snag two tickets to a musical.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.36,0:15:13.84,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Kinda like a class trip, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.60,0:15:19.10,sign_21953_217_Kyoraku_Theater,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz352.6\move(261.2,240,298,238.4,23,3484)}Kyoraku Theater
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.15,0:15:24.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Are you that excited for the musical?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.60,0:15:26.55,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Oh... no,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.55,0:15:30.10,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I was just thinking it really \Nis like going on a class trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:35.36,main,eiji,0,0,0,,In that case, we should do \Nsome more class trip stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.06,0:15:37.12,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:40.05,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I guess that'd include pillow fights...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.47,0:15:42.75,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That always comes to mind \Nwhen traveling with groups.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.75,0:15:45.21,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Don't you agree, Imp-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.26,0:15:53.64,main,Imp Rin,0,0,0,,It'd be boring if we didn't stay \Nthe night, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.30,0:16:00.09,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Whoa! You almost had me hollering!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.51,0:16:52.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Does Tsundere-chan mind heights?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.12,0:16:55.37,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,N-Not really. This isn't scary at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.96,0:16:57.41,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,But you'd better not push me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.78,0:16:59.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Is this that thing where you keep \Ngoing "Don't do it! Don't do it, man!"?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:01.32,main,Rin,0,0,0,,It's not a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.65,0:17:03.96,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,How can you even suggest that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.41,0:17:07.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I was just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.43,0:17:20.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This is perfect scenery for Demure-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.44,0:17:25.16,main,Demure Rin,0,0,0,,The humble surroundings still give you a \Nfeel for this ancient city's air of elegance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.16,0:17:36.82,main,Little Sis Rin,0,0,0,,Onii-chan, I want dango!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.57,0:17:40.24,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Seven servings, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.24,0:17:41.62,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.13,0:17:51.33,main,Rin,0,0,0,,What souvenirs should we get?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:56.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I bet Cool-chan would love this sensu fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:00.69,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,See?! Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.22,0:18:02.60,main,Cool Rin,0,0,0,,I'll take good care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.09,0:18:05.84,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,Hey, what do I get?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.84,0:18:09.10,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,I'd say Spoiled-chan gets this \Nkinchaku bag with the cat pattern!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.32,0:18:13.51,main,Spoiled Rin,0,0,0,,I wanted to get the Japanese sweets instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.51,0:18:15.36,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's still got a cat on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.36,0:18:21.87,sign_26263_248_Kyoto_Souvenirs_,Tackground sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H3A296C&\frz359.8\pos(363,52.8)}{\blur0.8}Kyoto Souvenirs Kikuya
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.63,0:18:18.59,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,That said, getting the run-around \Nfrom Spoiled-chan feels appropriate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.59,0:18:20.66,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe that is the right choice...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.43,0:18:26.04,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It was a good idea, coming together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.04,0:18:27.61,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,So, what about you, Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.91,0:18:29.26,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.82,0:18:32.37,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I'd be happy no matter what I get, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.75,0:18:36.76,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Not that. I mean, are you \Nenjoying our little trip together?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.07,0:18:39.09,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Definitely!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:42.12,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Pick something out for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.12,0:18:44.16,main,Rin,0,0,0,,You, Senpai...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.37,0:18:45.95,main,Rin,0,0,0,,This!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.34,0:18:48.19,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Y-You nailed it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.64,0:18:51.40,sign_27061_261_Day_Trip__Onsen_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H4C4C4E&\fnTimes New Roman\b0\pos(475.2,234)}Day Trip \NOnsen Baths
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:10.65,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Senpai, I bought some drinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.68,0:19:13.17,main,Rin,0,0,0,,He fell asleep...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.13,0:19:44.39,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,W-What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.60,0:19:51.25,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I... want to stay with you forever, Senpai.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.28,0:19:53.25,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:57.91,main,Rin,0,0,0,,C-Could you... f-forget \Nabout what I just said?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.85,0:20:01.52,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I just got out of the bath, \Nso my hair is still a mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.52,0:20:03.96,main,Rin,0,0,0,,and my head's not sorted out, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.86,0:20:06.22,main,Rin,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.07,0:20:09.72,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I want to have another \Nchance to do it right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.82,0:20:17.75,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:25.24,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I really do love him, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.72,0:20:33.75,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,This place is gorgeous, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:36.25,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I-It sure is, yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.66,0:20:37.60,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Yup?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.75,0:20:43.89,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,What do I do? I can't talk properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.89,0:20:46.89,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,The cobblestones are kinda \Ntough to walk on, so be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.89,0:20:49.88,main - italics,Rin,0,0,0,,I'm too embarrassed to even face him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.11,0:20:51.64,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:06.99,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Maybe we should just hold hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.49,0:21:13.49,main,Rin,0,0,0,,I can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.49,0:21:15.58,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It's not easy for me, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:17.09,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.42,0:21:23.00,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Hey... good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:26.95,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Kinda cold today, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.72,0:21:31.34,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,We better be careful not to get sick, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.34,0:21:32.52,main,Rin,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.08,0:21:35.80,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,It'd be nice to go on another trip, \Nhuh, Tsundere-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.87,0:21:40.52,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Well... I thought it might \Nmake it easier for you to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.73,0:21:42.56,main,Eiji,0,0,0,,Since I want to talk with you, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.15,0:21:48.03,main,TsundeRin,0,0,0,,N-Next time, I get to decide where we go!
